        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9007P/400, Ultra Sleek Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape of this Omnia made refrigerator pull ensures that it will be an eye-catcher. It is a great finishing touch to your kitchen. This Ultra Sleek Appliance Pull is 17-15/16\" long and just 5/8\" thick for a sleek, modern look. It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes. Since this simple pull is so easy to clean it will maintain a smooth, rich luster for the lifetime of your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: matching <a href=\"/products/ultra-sleek-cabinet-pull-omnia-9007\"><b>Curved Cabinet Pull</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ultra Sleek Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 15-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
